#: kocrgocr.cpp:143
msgid ""
"Clusters smaller than this value\n"
"will be considered to be dust and \n"
"removed from the image.\n"
"\n"
"Default is 10"
msgstr ""
"Kelompok lebih kecil daripada nilai ini\n"
"akan dianggap menjadi debu dan\n"
